  "description": "Toucan is a bird-shaped play structure built for children who like to climb back up the slide. Its green arch climber forms the back, a red tail rises at one end, a yellow beak panel marks the head, and a blue slide runs down from the top. A climbing net and arch rungs lead up, and children jump, slide and climb again in quick loops. It is planned for 5 to 12 year olds and a group of up to 15. The product area is 20'9\" x 5'8\", so it fits a narrow strip. Play here builds social interaction and observation. The structure comes in multiple colours and has a 3-year warranty on pipe, roto-moulded parts, laminates and rope. Ask us to mark its safe zone on your plan.",
